{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「天王嫂」方媛自從為郭富城誕下三名千金後，一直將重心放在家庭與照顧女兒身上。前日她突然在社交平台公開一段私人健 …</p><p></p>\n<p>「天王嫂」方媛自從為郭富城誕下三名千金後，一直將重心放在家庭與照顧女兒身上。前日她突然在社交平台公開一段私人健身訓練片段，大方展示產後最真實體態。</p>\n<h2>方媛公開私人健身訓練片段</h2>\n<p>前日方媛在社交平台分享一段常規健身訓練影片，親自示範如何練出緊緻身體線條以及飽滿臀形。畫面中她穿上黑色運動內衣搭配緊身瑜伽褲，全神貫注地進行各項器械訓練，大方展露平坦腹部與清晰可見馬甲線。即使已經先後經歷三次生育，她全身依然保持零贅肉狀態，完美體態完全看不出已經是三名女兒母親，極致自律表現令大批觀看影片網民感到相當震驚。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765230792339_18968358266afeb614a849e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"4c5W8uyudfs93TFv7FODBh75E5vaVQDH_dZjjv3WY44.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765230792339_18968358266afeb614a849e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>天王嫂親自剖白產後真實心聲</h2>\n<p>針對外界對其極速恢復身形關注，方媛在影片中親自發聲交代狂操肌背後原因。她坦言自從升級成為母親後，絕大部分時間與精力都全數投放在三名愛女及家庭瑣事上。不過她漸漸發覺若果長期將自己需求放在最後一位，整個人狀態反而會變得異常疲憊。因此她下定決心改變現狀，強調無論日常育兒生活有多繁忙，都必須堅持每天擠出時間進行高強度健身訓練，藉此改善產後疲態並重拾活力。</p>\n<h2>郭富城與愛妻組幸福一家五口</h2>\n<p>回顧這段相差22載天王婚姻，郭富城與方媛於2017年正式步入婚姻殿堂，婚後生活一直保持低調且恩愛。兩人先後迎接現年9歲長女郭詠希以及7歲次女郭詠萱誕生，去年再添一名快滿1歲幼女郭詠心，正式組成一家五口熱鬧家庭。近年大女和二女更入讀知名國際學校，單是學費每年便高達40萬港元。為減輕丈夫負擔，女方除了相夫教子外，亦積極經營個人社交平台事業，早前更親自上陣拍攝短片推銷嬰兒用品。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765480776656_8188701856afeb61731ac4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"郭富城 方媛 （圖片來源：Instagram@mokafy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765480776656_8188701856afeb61731ac4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@mokafy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民激讚方媛產後猶如年輕少女</h2>\n<p>這段健身影片曝光後迅速在網絡引起極大迴響，大批網民湧入留言區熱烈討論其產後狀態。許多人對她誕下三胎後仍能維持少女般體態表示不可思議，紛紛留言驚嘆「為什麼生了三胎還可以身材這麼好啊」、「真的生了三胎嗎？」以及「三胎猶如少女」。部分網民認為她極度自律，直指「生了三個能保持這麼好」、「很自律厲害」；同時亦有人猜測她本身屬於易瘦體質，表示「本身都已經很瘦」、「這就是單純瘦吧」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765569063733_15854013676afeb61835ae8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"e7KEtENnsNXY-zktX_oLKhBkX9X-3MhUiuxUN4rsVDc.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765569063733_15854013676afeb61835ae8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765864122133_5579259096afeb61b0acf6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"rQ6FyOwVW30rhXsX0VJioB75OLGrSOsA39iIOt_YiDo.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765864122133_5579259096afeb61b0acf6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507766077581004_2066459456afeb61d2e1a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ic-uGokXVqxVcVrGv0pOzujvsiV1xD85a95D5WveQ-U.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507766077581004_2066459456afeb61d2e1a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%96%b9%e5%aa%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方媛</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%98%9f%e4%ba%8c%e4%bb%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">星二代</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e5%af%8c%e5%9f%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭富城</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3545894\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:35:50.353362+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1277,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:41:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:57:27.219639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:29:22.538101+00:00","content_hash":"f3037b4c840efaae4da8d62e2e3391942cb696c978986dab26e77aeb8167a38a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}